    "tagline": "Three maps, five modes, one trigger.",
    "description": "A team shooter that runs in the browser. Raiders and Wardens meet on even teams across Team Deathmatch, Plant and Defuse, Gun Game, Free for All and Knife Rounds. Movement and shots are worked out on the server, headshots hit hard and kill streaks get called out by the announcer. Play against bots without an account; online matches need one.",
